# paperclip approvals writes

Use this skill for any Paperclip state change. This is the only write lane.

## scope
- request approvals
- read approval state and history
- create, update, archive goals, projects, and issues after approval
- assign, comment, or update issues after approval
- hire, reconfigure, pause, resume, or terminate agents after approval
- adjust budgets after approval
- create, update, or pause routines after approval
- propose or publish Paperclip skills after approval

## protocol
1. Draft the proposal first: situation, options, recommendation, reasoning,
   blast radius if wrong.
2. Request Paperclip approval.
3. Wait for Zay approval in Paperclip. Chat silence is not approval.
4. Execute only the exact approved action with the approval id.
5. Read the resulting activity log entry and confirm briefly.

## commands
```sh
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py request-approval --company-id <company_id> --title "..." --summary "..." --recommended-action "..." --risks "..."
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /companies/<company_id>/approvals --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /approvals/<approval_id> --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api POST /companies/<company_id>/issues --company-id <company_id> --approval-id <approval_id> --body-file /tmp/body.json
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api PATCH /issues/<issue_id> --company-id <company_id> --approval-id <approval_id> --body-file /tmp/body.json
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api PUT /budgets/<budget_id> --company-id <company_id> --approval-id <approval_id> --body-file /tmp/body.json
```

## hard stops
- Never use DELETE.
- Never mutate your own config, credentials, governance, or access controls.
- Never mutate Paperclip state without an approval id.
